nd appears as a fresh Mateo submission on 9/30. It may have been reopened or reused, or the digest may be wrong. Confirm in the ticketing system before Mateo sees it.\n- The Hartford digest (2026-08-03) and the 2025-03-10 digest mention Vantorre issues without ticket numbers, so I didn't list them.\n- I can't see the ticketing system itself, only these three sources."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
